Subject: [PATCH] mtd: install BMT translation before registration and release it on remove

Partition registration calls block_isbad(), so translation must already be
active. Fail the probe if it cannot attach rather than expose untranslated
NAND. Keep the layer if unregistering fails, and detach it after success.

--- a/drivers/mtd/nand/spi/core.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/nand/spi/core.c
@@ -1730,13 +1730,14 @@
 		return ret;
 
 	mtk_bmt_attach(mtd);
+	ret = sdr_bmt_attach(mtd);
+	if (ret)
+		goto err_spinand_cleanup;
+
 	ret = mtd_device_register(mtd, NULL, 0);
 	if (ret)
 		goto err_spinand_cleanup;
 
-	/* Translate after registration: nothing reads the master until probe
-	 * returns, and partitions/UBI resolve the master ops at I/O time. */
-	sdr_bmt_attach(mtd);
 	return 0;
 
 err_spinand_cleanup:
@@ -1760,6 +1761,7 @@
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
 
+	sdr_bmt_detach(mtd);
 	mtk_bmt_detach(mtd);
 	spinand_cleanup(spinand);
 
